## Workshops

Outlines and public dates live at https://guiferreira.me/workshops/. Public sessions run at conferences, and the conference sells the seat. Private and team bookings go through Black Lab Studios at https://blacklabstudios.com/workshops/.

- [Build Your First AI Agent in .NET](https://guiferreira.me/workshops/build-your-first-ai-agent-in-net/): Build a working agent in .NET, with tool calling, memory and the agent loop. 2-day intensive
- [Designing Tests That Survive Refactorings](https://guiferreira.me/workshops/designing-tests-that-survive-refactorings/): Design tests that hold still while the code underneath them moves. Half-day workshop, no laptop
- [Mastering Test-Driven Development in C#](https://guiferreira.me/workshops/test-driven-development-csharp/): Red, green, refactor, applied to real dependencies and real legacy code. 2-day intensive
- [Build a Full-Stack AI App with .NET](https://www.aipowereddotnet.school/): Cohort-based learning experience, sold on its own site

